# Allowlist: nothing is tracked unless it is listed below.
# Private RSA-911 data and anything derived from it, evaluation outputs,
# paper drafts and Markdown notes stay local.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.sh
!requirements.txt
!.env.example
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!web/*.html
!web/static/*.js
!web/static/*.css

# Public data: crawled documents, the Chroma index built from them, and the benchmarks.
!_raw/**
!_processed/**
!docs_text/**
!chroma_db_adv/**
!chunks.jsonl
!manifest.csv
!dupes.csv
!sources.txt
!eval_benchmark.json
!eval_benchmark_full_system.json
!eval_benchmark_expanded.json

# Never tracked, even when a pattern above matches.
.DS_Store
*.md
!/README.md
.venv/
__pycache__/
.claude/
.gradio/
data/
logs/
exports/
archives/
statistics/runs/
statistics/comparison/runs/
statistics/current_evaluation/
statistics/paper/
*_rsa911*
